sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant Auth as Authentication Service
  participant User as User Service
  participant Post as Post Service
  participant Comment as Comment Service
  participant Notification as Notification Service

  Client->>Auth: POST /auth/register
  Client->>Auth: POST /auth/login
  Client->>User: POST /users/{id}/follow
  Client->>Post: POST /posts
  Notification->>User: GET /users/{author_id}/followers via Dapr
  Client->>Comment: POST /comments
  Notification->>Post: GET /posts/{post_id} via Dapr
  Client->>Notification: GET /notifications?user_id=...

